# Typography in context

Use type to make repeated household tasks quick to scan. Set it in Arial, on the [type scale](typography.html) that owns the sizes. Official font identity and promotional type treatments never override native Home Assistant usability.

## Examples

These examples use invented household details. They do not operate devices, and they do not show that every native Home Assistant surface follows this guidance.

